The theme was about our dad!

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:39.430
Oh, I can't wait to see it.

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.980
You intend to come?

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:46.100
Won't you just be mistaken for a criminal and taken by the police again?

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:51.740
It is true that I keep getting in trouble with the police even if I'm doing nothing.

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:54.450
I was arresting for simply delivering the forgotten panties.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.660
Even just going shopping, I get called out.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:59.120
They treat me as a kidnapper on my way home from the park.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:03.620
Even if I'm walking home alone, they ask if I'm up to no good.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:08.000
As long as you don't make me lose face, I'll consider letting you come to school, okay?

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.920
Don't talk to your father like that.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:14.050
No! Papa has to come to school!

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:16.130
No! You have to!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:18.550
If you shave and wear a suit, it might be all right.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:21.560
The beard makes me look thinner, doesn't it?

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:24.140
Of course not! You're nothing but a laughing stock.

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:29.360
In any case, if you show up looking like that, I won't speak with you!

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:32.610
She really hates me.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:34.900
Come on, let's take a bath!

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:41.410
Goodbye, beard.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:50.000
Take that!

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:54.670
What is this?

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:56.510
Did you shave yet?

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.390
I was just about to.

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:01.850
The fly got away.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.850
Make sure you shave it all off nice and clean!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:05.430
Don't leave a single hair standing!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.560
Nice and clean?

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:09.940
I see!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:18.700
Hello?!

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:31.420
I shaved it all off just like Mitsuba said.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.840
No matter how you look at it, I'm quite the elegant father now.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:38.680
The black suit does a nice job of making me look slim, and these sunglasses give off a great energy.

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:41.260
Whose bodyguard is that?

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:43.140
Doesn't he seem kind of scary?

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:48.180
I did tell him to shave his beard, but why did he go and shave his whole head?

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:49.350
Hey.

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:55.020
Forget about not talking to him! I'm not even going to look at him anymore!

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:59.110
Father, I hope that you're doing well and working hard!

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:00.280
That is all!

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.870
Well then, next up is Mitsuba!

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.080
Yes!

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.460
I love my papa.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:15.130
Th-This is Futaba's!

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:17.090
Why was her paper in my cubby?!

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:19.130
Hey, Futaba!

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:21.800
I can't eat another bite...

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:22.890
Is something wrong?

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:24.550
Um... No.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:44.240
I love my papa more than anything else in the world!

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:49.080
He's not only strong, but tall and considerate.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:54.880
He can be scary when he's mad, but we take a bath together every day!

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:57.460
Sometimes we even sleep together!

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:58.300
Is she serious?

00:19:58.300 --> 00:19:59.760
That's rather unexpected, isn't it?

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:03.720
I want to become a bride for my papa when I grow up!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:04.760
The end!

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:12.520
Well, that was a very straightforward way of expressing your love to your father. That was a very nice composition.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:17.730
I-I'm such a fool.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:20.570
I thought that I was being hated.

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:21.820
Mitsuba.

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:24.490
I love you, too.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.410
Next up is Futaba.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:28.700
Futaba?

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:31.660
Huh? Let me see.

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:36.750
My father is dirty, smelly, and a good-for-nothing.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:41.300
When he has breaks, he just sits around all day. It's so lame.

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:44.260
He passes gas all the time and I just wish he'd hold it in.

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:45.510
That's all.

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:49.220
Papa!

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:51.060
Papa!

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:53.310
I love you, Papa!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:56.600
Futaba...

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:30.350
There he is!

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:31.100
Stop where you are!

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:33.100
If you keep running, we'll shoot!

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.310
Hold on a second!

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:35.190
You've got it all wrong!

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:37.100
I came here for Class Visitation Day!

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.650
You? A parent?!

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:40.110
Damn it!

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:43.280
Stop resisting and we can talk this over.

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:45.280
Just listen to me!

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:49.780
Futaba! Mitsuba! Hitoha!

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:54.330
What? I feel like I heard my papa's voice just now.

00:22:17.040 --> 00:22:22.130
As the sun sets on the schoolyard

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:27.400
I waved my hand, and head back home

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:32.580
Tonight, when I go to bed

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:37.880
It'd be great if I can see you again

00:22:38.160 --> 00:22:43.430
Let's go to sleep

00:22:43.430 --> 00:22:47.380
I can't wait for tomorrow

00:22:49.570 --> 00:22:54.470
It's really wonderful in my dream, you see...

00:22:54.840 --> 00:22:59.370
You can even fly into the sky

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:13.920
My heart aches when I hold your hand, even in my dream

00:23:14.040 --> 00:23:19.380
Just like my dream-colored love

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:27.920
It's time for the athletic festival!

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:30.680
Sugisaki and Yoshioka, you guys don't seem very happy about it.

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:32.970
Bursts of sweat and rushes of youthful energy and stamina!

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:35.050
Then, the exaltation of victory!

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:36.510
Come on, you two, let's get fired up!

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:40.090
Hats and Underwear Go on Your Head ! ?

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:37.720
You're the same as always, aren't you?

00:23:37.720 --> 00:23:39.370
That's Miya for you.
